  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "SHARK-SEC-003: replace Thread.Sleep with await Task.Delay in graceful shutdown drain; true fire-and-forget so ApplicationStopping returns immediately. SHARK-SEC-004: make SagaExecutor.LockTtl configurable; add LockRenewalInterval with periodic lock extension (cross-repo Cache.Redis); ISagaStore.RenewLockAsync converted to default interface method so existing implementations keep compiling. SHARK-SEC-005 (cross-repo Cache.Redis): replace unconditional KeyDelete with check-and-delete Lua in RedisSagaStore / RedisCronJobStore; add CronScheduler.CronLockTtl + ICronJobStore.RenewJobLockAsync. Idempotency hardening: add MaxFingerprintBodySize (default 64 KiB); chunked-transfer requests now hash incrementally with -1 sentinel; setter rejects <= 0. SHARK-SEC-006 (AutoCrud.SqlSugar, BREAKING): add [CrudAllow] field allowlist; endpoints with zero [CrudAllow] properties throw InvalidOperationException at startup. SHARK-SEC-006 follow-ups (BREAKING): exclude SafeSoftDeleteField from [CrudAllow] allow-list even when explicitly marked; AutoCrud POST and PUT now return the persisted row re-read from DB.",
